  "title": "DASHA drops a wonderful single \"Dramatic\"",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Singer-songwriter DASHA delivers a new single called \"Dramatic,\" a special piece of audio that makes time slow down to enjoy the music limitlessly. With the tone set <strong>DASHA</strong> shows off her incredible melodic tone that takes you off your feet, as you get lost in the music and takes you higher like the best strains out there. The writing shines to the fullest and shows her ability to bring a concept to life to make work of art for people everywhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stream here: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1ECImIb0g5uPhKc4FLkHXa\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/1ECImIb0g5uPhKc4FLkHXa\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Follow&nbsp;Dasha</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/dashanovotny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Facebook</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dashamusic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/dasha__music?s=21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Twitter</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7Ez6lTtSMjMf2YSYpukP1I?si=CUqW0DqcTTWJlLNqr3foZw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spotify</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<a href=\"https://music.apple.com/us/artist/dasha/1462663731\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apple</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
